# AI agent management
# Tracked (long-term, shared): AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, CONTEXT.md (domain language),
#   docs/agents/** (reference + skill config), .scratch/** (the issue tracker — markdown, in git).
# Ignored (ephemeral, per-dev): docs/temp/** (incl. SESSION.md), and legacy Gemini files below.
docs/temp/
.gemini/
gemini.md
flutter.md
.tasks/
.claude/settings.local.json

